cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Noema in academic or technical work, please cite it as below."
title: Noema
abstract: >-
  An original, open-source, self-hosted workspace for notes, docs and databases.
  Everything is a page: documents, folders and database rows share one model,
  with typed databases, a block editor, comments, version history, tickets,
  projects and AI on your own key. It runs as a hosted site, or as a desktop app
  that bundles its own runtime and embedded database.
type: software
